{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Reach your target in side-scrolling platformer, beat them in epic bullet hell !</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platform</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pav Tech, the player character, moves continuously forward. It's up to you to make him stop, jump and shoot through creative obstacles !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pav must fight bosses in bullet hell, where he can switch between fight mode to shoot and flight mode to dodge obstacles. Beware to not lose the connexion !\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pav Tech, sapient robot, and his friend, Alvin Biffle, are prompted to join Silverstraif, an organization ran by Harold Decibel made to obliterate The Corruption. He meets Ivana Pocus, cursed librarian ; Ariana Gizmo, independant inventor ; Dianna Palter, punk skater going at light speed and Lucian Halo, stupid chessmaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pav must now explore all 5 countries to get rid of its Corruption all while answering his life-long question : Who is he really ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Corruption</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Corruption is an army of weird beings invading the minds of citizens throughout the entire world. Where do they come from ? What is their goal ?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"New Hero in Town","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3660270/eee2a0d4f4b0f84c29cf27102efcca4300ef2d61.jpg"},{"name":"No More Ice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3660270/daa96c27e69698f870292f365ceda66c24bf65b3.jpg"},{"name":"Peaceful Again","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3660270/5d528a6e